**Definition (`shift`).** Successor neighbourhood shift on subsets of $\mathbb{N}$.

*Proof.* As in the formal module. ∎
**Definition (`tail`).** Tail neighbourhood $\{m\mid n\le m\}$.

*Proof.* As in the formal module. ∎
